Packet 1
Protocol : DNS
OSI Layer: Layer 7 - Application Layer
Reason   : DNS is used by applications to convert a domain name
           such as google.com into an IP address.


Packet 2
Protocol : TCP
OSI Layer: Layer 4 - Transport Layer
Reason   : TCP provides reliable communication between two devices
           and manages the delivery of data.


Packet 3
Protocol : TLS
OSI Layer: Layer 6 - Presentation Layer
Reason   : TLS encrypts and protects the data being transferred
           between the client and server.
